{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04790","headline":"春雨早雷 · 张说","name":"春雨早雷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东北春风至，飘飘带雨来。\n拂黄先变柳，点素早惊梅。\n树蔼悬书阁，烟含作赋台。\n河鱼未上冻，江蛰已闻雷。\n美人宵梦着，金屏曙不开。\n无缘一啓齿，空酌万年杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}